  triage:title "rust-qa-agent QA-003: print_doctor_roster's new multi-team-block rendering has no dedicated output test" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1300-r1 (PR #1300, AY.13 doctor team scope). print_doctor_roster now iterates report.team_rosters to print one 'Members:' block per team for --all-teams CLI text output, but no test in crates/atm/src/output.rs asserts multi-team block rendering (existing doctor-output tests cover peer/Herdr sections, not this new multi-roster branch). No occurrence of team_rosters in any #[test] fn within crates/atm/src/output.rs." ;
