  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr independently confirmed via git show c0afd678d: print_doctor_roster/print_doctor_roster_block were refactored into pure render_doctor_rosters/render_doctor_roster_block functions returning String instead of println!-ing directly, and a new #[test] doctor_roster_rendering_prints_one_heading_per_team builds a two-team MembersList slice and asserts the rendered string contains exactly two 'Members: ' occurrences, one per team name -- directly covering the previously-untested multi-team-block branch. Personally-run cargo test -p agent-team-mail green at branch head cb13ca7e38 / current PR head 8ae936a37. Closing on this evidence." .
